            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "輝達市值暴增近1兆美元！川普：沒人能像黃仁勳讓股價起死回生",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c23ffa5b45a74109099d597226c454eb96b533d3120e50b802452b7a46054a7e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Fd4d59484fb843d974b6e63fc5389719b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E8%BC%9D%E9%81%94%E5%B8%82%E5%80%BC%E6%9A%B4%E5%A2%9E%E8%BF%911%E5%85%86%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83-%E5%B7%9D%E6%99%AE-%E6%B2%92%E4%BA%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%83%8F%E9%BB%83%E4%BB%81%E5%8B%B3%E8%AE%93%E8%82%A1%E5%83%B9%E8%B5%B7%E6%AD%BB%E5%9B%9E%E7%94%9F-222016355.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-24 07:13:17",
