        {
            "title": "黃仁勳一回來就重傷空頭！輝達3倍放空產品暴跌逾91%",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">黃仁勳重返輝達(NVDA-US)執行長職位，帶動股價周一(23日)一度大漲約34%，卻讓押注股價下跌的槓桿產品遭遇重擊。一檔在歐洲掛牌的3倍放空輝達產品，盤中一度暴跌逾91%，並曾暫停交易。</p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"(圖：ZeroHedge)\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"562\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/547c3c6949137763746983dcd409d2935f0f37442c245a8b2761ee2b95a58034/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2F98bef7b9276178b398076288c2d03567.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">(圖：ZeroHedge)</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">綜合財經網站ZeroHedge與ETF專業媒體ETF Stream報導，Leverage Shares發行的3倍反向輝達交易所交易產品(ETP)，其倫敦掛牌、美元計價版本NV3S，一度從上周五收盤的3.475美元跌至0.30美元，跌幅達91.37%。若以上周五收盤價買進，按此價格計算，部位市值僅剩原本約8.6%。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-abea68da-06b1-3385-8558-f41fa5d72410-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"(圖：ZeroHedge)\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"495\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/79794281b12fa1b0dd7672bd5fb9d3d55b51e24531e644d9a1c586f5e9231cd5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Ff286d1a302168adbe0fdff2bfa76e128.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">(圖：ZeroHedge)</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">彭博行業研究ETF分析師Eric Balchunas在社群平台X分享相關報價畫面，也指出該產品英鎊計價版本曾顯示「自動暫停交易：超出容許波動範圍」的訊息，引發市場關注。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">這場逆轉之前，押注輝達下跌的交易才剛帶來可觀報酬。NV3S從11月9日的約1.75美元，漲至上周五的約3.48美元，短短兩周價格接近翻倍，光是上周五便上漲約37%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">但川普周日晚間公開呼籲輝達重新聘用黃仁勳後，公司董事會周一便宣布讓他即刻復職，並表示在取得美國政府高層意見後，確信其回任不構成國安風險。消息推升輝達股價，也讓反向產品先前的漲勢急轉直下。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">這類產品為何跌得如此劇烈？依發行商說明，其目標是在扣除費用前，提供輝達「單日報酬的反向3倍」。簡單來說，輝達若上漲1%，產品理論上便下跌約3%；但遇到盤中再平衡與極端行情時，實際報酬不能直接以整天股價漲幅乘以負3計算。</p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"(圖：ZeroHedge)\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"495\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/655d03f932d59528f6b281777d9af5d530a9ca3a6587f8e3c19f16fee2fd9996/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Ff5f424e56a9077413b49f3858703e245.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">(圖：ZeroHedge)</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Leverage Shares也設有被稱為「安全氣囊」的盤中再平衡機制，當標的股價出現約16.67%的不利變動時觸發，以降低極端行情下的損失風險。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">據ETF Stream報導，這次急漲確實觸發了該機制，產品暫停交易後已恢復交易。Leverage Shares全球傳訊與策略主管Oktay Kavrak表示，產品並未歸零，安全氣囊發揮了降低全部損失風險的作用。同日，GraniteShares另一檔3倍放空輝達產品3SNV，也一度下跌約92.1%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Balchunas將這次暴跌與2018年的反向波動率商品XIV事件相提並論。當年市場波動劇烈，XIV指示價值重挫，觸發提前贖回條款，發行商隨後宣布提前贖回。兩者追蹤標的與結構不同，但都呈現出反向產品在行情突然逆轉時，損失可能迅速擴大的特性。</p><p class=\"read-more-vendor mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><span>更多鉅亨報導</span><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"黃仁勳回歸 空頭笑不出來！輝達股價飆33% 單日帳面虧122億美元\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:黃仁勳回歸 空頭笑不出來！輝達股價飆33%25 單日帳面虧122億美元;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6670369?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">黃仁勳回歸 空頭笑不出來！輝達股價飆33% 單日帳面虧122億美元</a><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"才說不回聘 轉眼又迎回！輝達為何離不開黃仁勳？\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:才說不回聘 轉眼又迎回！輝達為何離不開黃仁勳？;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6670363?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">才說不回聘 轉眼又迎回！輝達為何離不開黃仁勳？</a></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E9%BB%83%E4%BB%81%E5%8B%B3-%E5%9B%9E%E4%BE%86%E5%B0%B1%E9%87%8D%E5%82%B7%E7%A9%BA%E9%A0%AD-%E8%BC%9D%E9%81%943%E5%80%8D%E6%94%BE%E7%A9%BA%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81%E6%9A%B4%E8%B7%8C%E9%80%BE91-180214632.html",
